#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:97 imageplugin_whitebalance.cpp:62
msgid "White Color Balance Correction"
msgstr "Wittbalangs-Korrektuur"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:99
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to correct white color balance."
msgstr "En digiKam-Korrektuurmoduul för de Wittbalangs"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:105
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:108
msgid "White color balance correction algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmus för't Richten vun de Wittbalangs"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:116
msgid ""
"<p>You can see here the image's white-balance adjustments preview. You can pick "
"color on image to see the color level corresponding on histogram."
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is en Vöransicht för de Wittbalangs-Topassen vun dat Bild. Du kannst en "
"Klöör ut dat Bild utsöken un Di de tohören Klöörstoop in dat Histogramm "
"ankieken."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:128
msgid "Channel:"
msgstr "Kanaal:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:131
msgid "Luminosity"
msgstr "Helligkeit"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:132
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Root"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:133
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Gröön"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:134
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Blaag"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:135
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the histogram channel to display:"
"<p><b>Luminosity</b>: display the image's luminosity values."
"<p><b>Red</b>: display the red image-channel values."
"<p><b>Green</b>: display the green image-channel values."
"<p><b>Blue</b>: display the blue image-channel values."
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den Histogramm-Kanaal utsöken, den Du wiest hebben wullt:"
"<p><b>Bildhelligkeit</b>: wiest de Bildhelligkeit-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Root</b>: wiest de Rootkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Gröön</b>: wiest de Gröönkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p><b>Blaag</b>: wiest de Blaagkanaal-Weerten vun dat Bild."
"<p>"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:145
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the histogram scale."
"<p>If the image's maximal counts are small, you can use the linear scale."
"<p>Logarithmic scale can be used when the maximal counts are big; if it is "
"used, all values (small and large) will be visible on the graph."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Histogramm-Skala utsöken."
"<p>Wenn de Hööchstweert vun dat Bild siet is, kannst Du de lineare Skala "
"bruken."
"<p>De logaritmisch Skala lett sik bi grote Hööchstweerten bruken. So warrt all "
"Weerten (siete un hoge) in de Grafik wiest."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:152
msgid "<p>Linear"
msgstr "<p>Lineaar"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:160
msgid "<p>Logarithmic"
msgstr "<p>Logaritmisch"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:177
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can see the target preview image histogram drawing of the selected "
"image channel. This one is re-computed at any filter settings changes."
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is dat Histogramm vun't Teelbild sien aktuell Klöörkanaal. Dat warrt na "
"elk Ännern vun de Filter-Instellen nieg utreekt."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:191
msgid "Exposure:"
msgstr "Belichten:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:194
msgid "Auto exposure adjustments"
msgstr "Automaatsch Belichten-Topassen"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:195
msgid ""
"<p>With this button, you can automatically adjust Exposure and Black Point "
"values."
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit dissen Knoop laat sik de Belichten- un Swattpunkt-Weerten automaatsch "
"topassen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:200
msgid "<p>Set here the Exposure Value (EV)."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du den Belichtenweert fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:202
msgid "Black point:"
msgstr "Swattpunkt:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:206
msgid "<p>Set here the black level value."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du den Stoopweert för Swatt fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:208
msgid "Shadows:"
msgstr "Schaddens:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:212
msgid "<p>Set here the shadows noise suppresion level."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du de Stoop för't Minnern vun Schaddenrusen fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:214
msgid "Saturation:"
msgstr "Sattheit:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:218
msgid "<p>Set here the saturation value."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du de Sattheit fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:220
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr "Gamma:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:224
msgid "<p>Set here the gamma correction value."
msgstr "<p>Hier kannst Du den Gamma-Weert fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:228
msgid "Temperature:"
msgstr "Temperatuur:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:232
msgid "<p>Set here the white balance color temperature in Kelvin."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Klöörtemperatuur (in Kelvin) för de Wittbalangs topassen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:234
msgid "Preset:"
msgstr "Vörinstellen:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:236
msgid "40W Lamp"
msgstr "40W-Beer"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:237
msgid "200W Lamp"
msgstr "200W-Beer"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:238
msgid "Sunrise"
msgstr "Sünnopgang"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:239
msgid "Tungsten Lamp"
msgstr "Wolfram-Lamp"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:240
msgid "Neutral"
msgstr "Neutraal"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:241
msgid "Xenon Lamp"
msgstr "Xenon-Lamp"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:242
msgid "Sun"
msgstr "Sünn"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:243
msgid "Photo Flash"
msgstr "Blixlicht"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:244
msgid "Sky"
msgstr "Heven"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:245
msgid "None"
msgstr "Keen"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:246
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the white balance color temperature preset to use:"
"<p><b>40W Lamp</b>: 40 Watt incandescent lamp (2680K)."
"<p><b>200W Lamp</b>: 200 Watt incandescent lamp (3000K)."
"<p><b>Sunrise</b>: sunrise or sunset light (3200K)."
"<p><b>Tungsten Lamp</b>: tungsten lamp or light at 1 hour from dusk/dawn "
"(3400K)."
"<p><b>Neutral</b>: neutral color temperature (4750K)."
"<p><b>Xenon Lamp</b>: xenon lamp or light arc (5000K)."
"<p><b>Sun</b>: sunny daylight around noon (5500K)."
"<p><b>Photo Flash</b>: electronic photo flash (5600K)."
"<p><b>Sky</b>: overcast sky light (6500K)."
"<p><b>None</b>: no preset value."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Klöörtemperatuur för de Wittbalangs-Vörinstellen utsöken:"
"<p><b>40W-Beer</b>: elektrisch Beer mit 40 Watt (2680K)."
"<p><b>200W-Beer</b>: elektrisch Beer mit 200 Watt (3000K)."
"<p><b>Sünnopgang</b>: Sünnopgang- oder Sünnünnergang-Licht (3200K)."
"<p><b>Wolframlamp</b>: Wolfram-Lamp, liek as Licht een Stünn vun't Schummern "
"weg (3400K)."
"<p><b>Neutraal</b>: neutraal Klöör-Temperatuur (4750K)."
"<p><b>Xenonlamp</b>: Xenon-Lamp oder Lichtbagen (5000K)."
"<p><b>Sünn</b>: Sünnlicht to Middag (5500K)."
"<p><b>Blixlicht</b>: elektrisch Blix (5600K)."
"<p><b>Heven</b>: bedeckt Heven (6500K)."
"<p><b>Keen</b>: keen Weert vörinstellt."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:264
msgid "Temperature tone color picker."
msgstr "Klöörtemperatuur-Utwahl"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:265
msgid ""
"<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set "
"white color balance temperature and green component."
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du de Klöör ut dat Orginaalbild utsöken, de Du för't "
"Fastleggen vun de Witt-Klöörtemperatuur un den Gröön-Andeel bruken wullt."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:268
msgid "Green:"
msgstr "Gröön:"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:272
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the green component to set magenta color cast removal level."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du den Gröön-Andeel för de Stärk vun de Magenta-Minnern "
"fastleggen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:274
msgid "Over exposure indicator"
msgstr "Överbelichten wiesen"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:275
msgid ""
"<p>If you enable this option, over-exposed pixels from the target image preview "
"will be over-colored. This will not have an effect on the final rendering."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du disse Optschoon anmaakst, warrt överbelicht Pixels in de "
"Teelbild-Vöransicht överteekt. Dit warkt sik nich op de Enn-Dorstellen ut."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:705
msgid "White Balance"
msgstr "Wittbalangs"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:882
msgid "White Color Balance Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Instellendatei för de Wittbalangs laden"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:895
msgid "\"%1\" is not a White Color Balance settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" is keen Text-Instellendatei för Wittbalangs-Instellen."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:914
msgid "Cannot load settings from the White Color Balance text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich ut de Textdatei för de Wittbalangs laden."

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:924
msgid "White Color Balance Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Instellendatei för de Wittbalangs sekern"

#: imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:943
msgid "Cannot save settings to the White Color Balance text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich na de Textdatei för de Wittbalangs sekern."

#: imageplugin_whitebalance.cpp:42
msgid "White Balance..."
msgstr "Wittbalangs..."

